<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11724" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειρέσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boundless, immense,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖα, ὀϊζύς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				20.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.621
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					4
				</span></i>
			; <i>countless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρωποι πολλοί, ἀπειρέσιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.174
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				134.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.100
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνιθες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἶδος</span>
			<i>untold</i> beauty, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; once in Trag., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πόνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					928
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): neut. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				2.179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.386
			</span></i>. (Like <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερείσιος,</span> by
			metrical lengthening for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπερέσιος;</span> root <i>per-</i> in 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεῖραρ, ἄπειρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
				</span></i>
			)</div>
